{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../anonymous/client/", "title": "Client"}, "next": {"link": "../my_account_client/", "title": "My Account Client"}, "title": "Mfa Client", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth_server.mfa_client\">\n<span id=\"mfa-client\"></span><h1>Mfa Client<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth_server.mfa_client\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>MFA Client for auth0-server-python SDK.\nHandles Multi-Factor Authentication operations against the Auth0 MFA API.</p>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL\" title=\"auth_server.mfa_client.DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER\" title=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper autosummary longtable docutils container\">\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient\" title=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Client for Auth0 MFA API operations.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_server.mfa_client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">domain</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Callable</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client_id</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">client_secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">secret</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_store</span></span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">state_identifier</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">'_a0_session'</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">headers</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">session_establisher</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Callable</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">...</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Awaitable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Awaitable</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">mfa_token_ttl</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#int\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">int</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">apply_client_authentication</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Callable</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">use_mtls</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#bool\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">bool</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">False</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">ssl_context</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/ssl.html#ssl.SSLContext\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">ssl.SSLContext</span></a><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">token_endpoint_resolver</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Callable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Callable</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">...</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.abc.html#collections.abc.Awaitable\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">collections.abc.Awaitable</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Client for Auth0 MFA API operations.</p>\n<p>Provides methods for listing authenticators, enrolling new authenticators,\ndeleting authenticators, challenging authenticators, and verifying MFA codes.</p>\n<p>All public API methods accept an encrypted mfa_token (as issued by\nMfaRequiredError) and decrypt it internally. Callers never handle the\nraw Auth0 mfa_token directly.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.challenge_authenticator\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">challenge_authenticator</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.ChallengeResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.challenge_authenticator\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Initiates an MFA challenge for user verification.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Dict containing \u2018mfa_token\u2019, \u2018factor_type\u2019 (otp, sms, voice, email, auth0),\nand optionally \u2018authenticator_id\u2019.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Optional options passed to the State Store (e.g. request/response).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>ChallengeResponse with challenge details.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaChallengeError\" title=\"error.MfaChallengeError\"><strong>MfaChallengeError</strong></a> \u2013 When the challenge fails.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 If neither client_secret nor client_assertion_signing_key is configured.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.decrypt_mfa_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">decrypt_mfa_token</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">encrypted_token</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.MfaTokenContext</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.decrypt_mfa_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Decrypt an MFA token and validate TTL.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.enroll_authenticator\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">enroll_authenticator</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.EnrollmentResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.enroll_authenticator\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Enrolls a new MFA authenticator for the user.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Dict containing enrollment parameters.\nRequired: \u2018mfa_token\u2019, \u2018factor_type\u2019 (otp, sms, voice, email, auth0).\nOptional: \u2018phone_number\u2019, \u2018email\u2019.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Optional options passed to the State Store (e.g. request/response).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>OtpEnrollmentResponse or OobEnrollmentResponse.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaEnrollmentError\" title=\"error.MfaEnrollmentError\"><strong>MfaEnrollmentError</strong></a> \u2013 When enrollment fails.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.list_authenticators\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">list_authenticators</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#list\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">list</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.AuthenticatorResponse</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.list_authenticators\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Lists all MFA authenticators enrolled by the user.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Dict containing \u2018mfa_token\u2019 (raw, decrypted).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Optional options passed to the State Store (e.g. request/response).</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of enrolled authenticators.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\" title=\"error.MfaListAuthenticatorsError\"><strong>MfaListAuthenticatorsError</strong></a> \u2013 When the request fails.</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.verify\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">verify</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">store_options</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">dict</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">[</span></span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#str\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">str</span></a><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">,</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">Any</span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">]</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">dpop_key</span></span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">jwcrypto.jwk.JWK</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/constants.html#None\" title=\"(in Python v3.14)\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></a></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"default_value\"><span class=\"pre\">None</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span> <span class=\"sig-return\"><span class=\"sig-return-icon\">&#x2192;</span> <span class=\"sig-return-typehint\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_server_python.auth_types.MfaVerifyResponse</span></span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.verify\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Verifies an MFA code and completes authentication.</p>\n<p>Supports OTP, OOB (with binding code), and recovery code verification.</p>\n<p>If Auth0 returns \u2018mfa_required\u2019 again (chained MFA), raises MfaRequiredError\nwith a raw mfa_token. The framework SDK (e.g. auth0-fastapi) is responsible\nfor encrypting the token before returning it to the client.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><strong>options</strong> \u2013 Dict containing \u2018mfa_token\u2019 and one of:\n- \u2018otp\u2019: OTP code\n- \u2018oob_code\u2019 + \u2018binding_code\u2019: OOB verification\n- \u2018recovery_code\u2019: Recovery code\n- \u2018persist\u2019: bool (optional, default=False) - Persist tokens to state store\n- \u2018audience\u2019: str (optional, required if persist=True) - Audience for token_set\n- \u2018scope\u2019: str (optional) - Scope for token_set</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>store_options</strong> \u2013 Optional options passed to the State Store (e.g. request/response).</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>dpop_key</strong> \u2013 Optional EC P-256 JWK to DPoP-bind the token. Pass the same\nkey used at login (e.g. given to signin_with_passkey) to preserve\nthe sender constraint through step-up. Never stored by the SDK.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>MfaVerifyResponse with access_token, token_type, etc.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Raises<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaVerifyError\" title=\"error.MfaVerifyError\"><strong>MfaVerifyError</strong></a> \u2013 When verification fails, or when dpop_key was supplied\nbut the server returned an unbound (Bearer) token.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.MfaRequiredError\" title=\"error.MfaRequiredError\"><strong>MfaRequiredError</strong></a> \u2013 When chained MFA is required.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 If dpop_key is combined with use_mtls. DPoP and mTLS\nuse incompatible token-binding mechanisms and cannot be used together.</p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../error/#error.ConfigurationError\" title=\"error.ConfigurationError\"><strong>ConfigurationError</strong></a> \u2013 If neither client_secret nor client_assertion_signing_key is configured.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_server.mfa_client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">300</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth_server.mfa_client.MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth_server.mfa_client.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">=</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">'_a0_mfa_pending'</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["reference/auth_server/my_account_client/index", "My Account Client", "N", "next"], ["reference/auth_server/anonymous/client/index", "Client", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "reference/auth_server/mfa_client/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">Mfa Client</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.challenge_authenticator\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient.challenge_authenticator()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.decrypt_mfa_token\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient.decrypt_mfa_token()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.enroll_authenticator\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient.enroll_authenticator()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.list_authenticators\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient.list_authenticators()</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MfaClient.verify\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MfaClient.verify()</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DEFAULT_MFA_TOKEN_TTL</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth_server.mfa_client.MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">MFA_PENDING_IDENTIFIER</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": true, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "reference/auth_server/mfa_client/index", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/ethical-ads.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html", "sidebar/variant-selector.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": false, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#f2f2f2", "foreground": "#1e1e1e"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}